  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845813,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## James Bond 007: Agent Under Fire - PlayStation 2\n\nStep into the shoes of the legendary James Bond in *Agent Under Fire*, a thrilling first-person shooter for the PlayStation 2. Originally conceived as a sequel to *The World Is Not Enough*, this game delivers a completely original storyline, free from the constraints of any specific film.\n\nBond is tasked with rescuing CIA agent Zoe Nightshade from the clutches of Nigel Bloch, CEO of Identicon, a front for a sinister organization dealing in biological weaponry. Your mission: retrieve stolen DNA samples and uncover a plot to replace world leaders with clones.\n\nExperience a dynamic blend of gameplay styles – intense first-person shooting, exhilarating rail-shooter sequences, and pulse-pounding car chases. Utilize iconic gadgets like the Q-Claw and Walther PPK, alongside experimental weaponry like the Photon cannon. Choose your approach: stealthily infiltrate enemy bases or unleash a barrage of firepower. With a compelling narrative, diverse missions, and engaging multiplayer modes, *Agent Under Fire* offers a fresh and exciting Bond experience."
    },
